  "details": "1. Launch VRChat\n\n2. Open menu\n\n3. Open VRChat+ tab\n\n4. Select Prints gallery \n\n5. Select a Print image taken previously in a world that has now been deleted\n\n6. Select Share\n\n7. Select Drop Print\n\nThis causes the prints feature to not print out the image selected and prevents other previously taken prints from the gallery from being dropped into the world unless a new print photo is taken and shared via the print camera.\n\nVideo attached to demonstrate reproduction of the bug:\n\nhttps://youtu.be/gxyArDF0Niw\n\nA possible theory for the cause of this issue is that the world info data tied to the print no longer exists on the VRChat servers, causing an error when sharing the print taken.",
